<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain reports 37.5 mln dinar Q3 trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Bahrain reports 37.5 mln dinar Q3 trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahrain posted a 37.5 million dinar trade surplus in the third quarter of 1996 after a 2.7 million dinar deficit in the second quarter, Bahrain Monetary Agency figures showed.</p>
<p>Data in millions of Bahraini dinars</p>
<p>		    Q3 96   Q2 96   Q1 96   Q4 95   Q3 95</p>
<p>Total exports   400.90  366.90  418.30  409.50  364.60</p>
<p>     oil	  266.10  273.80  289.30  236.80  215.50</p>
<p>   non-oil*     134.80   93.10  129.00  172.70  149.10</p>
<p>Total imports   363.40  369.60  375.00  389.60  326.10</p>
<p>     oil	  150.60  164.70  167.00  128.80  116.50</p>
<p>   non-oil*     212.80  204.90  208.00  260.80  209.60</p>
<p>Trade balance   +37.5    -2.7   +43.3   +19.9   +38.5</p>
<p>*1996 provisional</p>
</text>
